{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：09:49 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<p>銅鑼灣維多利亞公園有野豬出沒。今日（22日）早上7時17分，一隻約一米長的野豬闖進維園範圍內，在公園不斷踱步，又在小山丘附近徘徊。其間牠享受日光浴，狀甚悠然自在。惟公園內晨運客見狀，大驚報警。</p>\n<p>警員接報指野豬由維園步往天后方向，隨即趕往現場，並手持盾牌戒備。人員其後通知漁農自然護理署，派員捕捉野豬。</p>\n<img alt=\"一隻約一米長的野豬闖進維多利亞公園。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e6d6e839a3f42699e5330ab9faa6ebd8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_39.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"野豬在小山丘附近徘徊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2d38c966c44a03fdeb31d3b6ff40fe0f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_38_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"野豬享受日光浴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/35d5e8b5b876aee0cbc5a17839f67c53/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_38_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2cfdb2e208760d8c6d92634da1933c6b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_38.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2039d91cffbbdff36dc151a80611deae/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_37.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員手持盾牌戒備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/00bdfa006f36c54e1332b372398efd75/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_40_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f802473725e27f0df420d1e739ba6dc0/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_40.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/24b96bee1036c272d5c7f774a7dc2330/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_42.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e9049e2ddd437f8d2cb6a5d8eea6dc34/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_41_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/bea7703aad23631e54723f032e03c9a6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_40_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員手持盾牌戒備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b5cbe9d0ffee1a3fe56391314c8a914a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_39_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8039c1266bba2ff85778a12fc3049e46/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_42_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>漁護署人員到場後擴大封鎖線，並帶備圍網和盾牌等圍捕野豬。其間人員向野豬發射麻醉槍，惟野豬中槍後反抗，狂奔越過圍網跑到水池對面花槽，經過一輪喘息後最終暈倒。事件擾攘超過4小時，至早上約11時30分，漁護署人員將野豬抬上客貨車帶走。</p>\n<img alt=\"漁護署職員到場，擴大封鎖線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e049f4f25230fcb959227b847df00cd2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_11_29_53_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"漁護署人員持盾牌圍捕野豬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/76b76731cc13004edf6c36793d89eaf8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_11_29_53.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b7cbfea7006a4c72b081dd777e172c71/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_11_29_56_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/102e2fb4014e0d1cd52c9aabc4193e6d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_11_29_55_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"野豬中槍狂奔越過圍網跑到水池對面花槽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d96f5c4b622eb3d74d0547592c0b7d46/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_11_29_57_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/657c38314105a735489053f704d639cc/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_11_29_57.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a3d9cee26d5d8de759eecc4df0f7012c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_11_29_56_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c3d250b56cfc497f3fb91818bc487693/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_11_29_56.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c07f23a8caa66ca228cb4f374b9a7c33/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_11_29_55.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c9edbd82cea986c026f7e1e6fc44ec14/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_11_29_54.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"野豬最終中麻醉槍暈倒就擒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/beda7f0f89113e2ce05fd37a04c289af/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_11_29_57_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"人員合力將捕捉到的野豬抬走。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/81fc44b8c9e152d6230f718e71566095/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_11_29_58.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/38f1bf6435ed2c8aea1210f008f28c4d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_11_29_59.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:01:08.465351+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":25,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T01:49:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T07:38:57.549159+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:58:03.319697+00:00","content_hash":"1c5ff9b9fe3cddc672b91fa420c45fa3890e1fe00cf85207feb8b8d24379efc6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}